From: mayipashu <mayipashu@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 18 Nov 2026 10:30:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] net: airoha: npu: Support WLAN RX-only offload mode

EN7581 boards equipped with MT7916 (e.g. H3C HM2004-DU) only offload the
RX path to the NPU: the WiFi chip has no NPU TX ring, and the vendor BSP
device tree marks such boards with "airoha,mt7916-rx-only-memory", which
reserves only the "pkt" and "ba" regions but no "tx-pkt".

airoha_npu_wlan_init_memory() currently treats every memory region as
mandatory, so of_reserved_mem_region_to_resource_byname() fails on boards
without "tx-pkt" and probe aborts, leaving the NPU unusable.

Make the TX-side regions conditional, exactly like "ba" already is: only
send the corresponding WLAN_FUNC_SET_WAIT_* command when the region is
actually described in the device tree. Boards that do provide them keep
the previous behaviour.

This is a prerequisite for enabling NPU offload on MT7916 designs, whose
NPU firmware (en7581_MT7916_npu_*.bin) is RX-only.

Signed-off-by: mayipashu <mayipashu@users.noreply.github.com>
---

--- a/drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_npu.c
+++ b/drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_npu.c
@@ -539,20 +539,33 @@
 	if (err)
 		return err;
 
-	cmd = WLAN_FUNC_SET_WAIT_TX_BUF_CHECK_ADDR;
-	err = airoha_npu_wlan_set_reserved_memory(npu, 0, "tx-bufid", cmd);
-	if (err)
-		return err;
+	/*
+	 * TX-side regions are optional: RX-only designs (MT7916) reserve
+	 * neither "tx-bufid" nor "tx-pkt", and must not be told to DMA
+	 * through buffers they never allocated.
+	 */
+	if (of_property_match_string(npu->dev->of_node, "memory-region-names",
+				     "tx-bufid") >= 0) {
+		cmd = WLAN_FUNC_SET_WAIT_TX_BUF_CHECK_ADDR;
+		err = airoha_npu_wlan_set_reserved_memory(npu, 0, "tx-bufid",
+							  cmd);
+		if (err)
+			return err;
+	}
 
 	cmd = WLAN_FUNC_SET_WAIT_PKT_BUF_ADDR;
 	err = airoha_npu_wlan_set_reserved_memory(npu, 0, "pkt", cmd);
 	if (err)
 		return err;
 
-	cmd = WLAN_FUNC_SET_WAIT_TX_PKT_BUF_ADDR;
-	err = airoha_npu_wlan_set_reserved_memory(npu, 0, "tx-pkt", cmd);
-	if (err)
-		return err;
+	if (of_property_match_string(npu->dev->of_node, "memory-region-names",
+				     "tx-pkt") >= 0) {
+		cmd = WLAN_FUNC_SET_WAIT_TX_PKT_BUF_ADDR;
+		err = airoha_npu_wlan_set_reserved_memory(npu, 0, "tx-pkt",
+							  cmd);
+		if (err)
+			return err;
+	}
 
 	if (of_property_match_string(npu->dev->of_node, "memory-region-names",
 				     "ba") >= 0) {
